:"2026-03-16T14:14:56+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165354025,"discussion_id":"d9047d61e0ab2efa75633bb8cec5f832ecf0692f","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-16T14:15:15+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-16T14:15:15+08:00","user":{"id":"68c7b1bbd94db731d1db8789","login":"lihui488","object_id":"68c7b1bbd94db731d1db8789","name":"lihui","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ec/fe/e7cfea8970842fe499077a65dacfbba2a822df6eedbff33a29dd00b0da4174ec.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/lihui488"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165354040,"discussion_id":"78e9b1af28edfc6a41ca51e8f7d1b0a13f747869","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复RMSNorm算子量化版本在计算`numRow`（输入张量的总元素数除以归一化维度大小）时的逻辑错误。原代码错误地排除了输入张量的最后一个维度来计算总元素数，导致当输入张量形状与gamma参数形状不匹配时，`numRow`计算错误，进而影响了算子切分和并行计算的正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改了`NormCommonTiling`函数中`numRow`和`numCol`的计算逻辑。核心改动是：`numRow`的计算改为先计算输入张量的总元素数，再除以gamma参数的总元素数（即归一化维度的大小），以确保正确性。同时，将`numCol`的计算来源从输入张量的最后一个维度改为gamma参数的总元素数，保证了维度定义的一致性。代码已包含对维度有效性和乘法溢出的安全检查。","created_at":"2026-03-16T14:15:21+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-16T14:15:21+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165354199,"discussion_id":"0090638c520e316e2839730b0c0a464727949283","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=b582e6c0e2c54a3f8168601c5b292c24&pipelineRunId=12a50b8cbff44ac9ab605a7bb827f7ff&projectName=CANN'>12a50b8cbff44ac9ab605a7bb827f7ff</a></